    ],
    "level": 2,
    "canonicalUrl": "https://quasar.dev/vue-components/floating-action-button#usage",
    "content": "There are two types of FABs: expandable (has sub-actions) and non-expandable.\n\n::: tip\nFor an exhausting list of options, please read the API cards (at the top of this page).\n:::",
